experiment: slotmat
  SHORT RUN — 450000 ticks against a minimum of 900000. derived: §59a. THE RULER, AND IT CARRIES NO PRIMARY. §58 named a re-score on
  its expression ramp as the next test, and §58's OWN LOG says that is
  underpowered: one eighth reads SE 0.0338 and FOUR read 0.0297, so quadrupling
  the window width buys 12% -- the between-creature component is a floor near
  0.029 that width does not touch, which is the same quantity that made §58's
  projection 23% low. A two-eighth window is therefore ~0.031 against an
  averaging prediction of +0.1228, a separation of 3.96 SE, UNDER sw_classify's
  own A >= 4E gate: the named test would return UNDEFINED. Nor can the power
  come from a longer session, because the sleep prune is first reachable at
  ~1.04M ticks and would turn a mechanism ON inside the comparison. So this run
  MEASURES the slot term's SE over every one of the 36 contiguous eighth-windows
  and sizes §59b from the one the pre-registration fixed in advance (e6-e7, from
  the ramp's plateau, with e5-e7 the single declared fallback and a 96-creature
  affordability limit stated first) -- a separate run from the test precisely so
  the window is not chosen from the data it is then tested in. SECOND PRODUCT,
  and it is §58's item 2: one new per-probe byte splits what probe_g_ok
  conflates, so `no voiced frame` and `index never live` are counted apart. §58
  found T1.ORACLE -- PINNED, whose index CANNOT collapse -- scoring n 1 of 12 in
  e8, and G2 derives from source that a pinned probe sets pin_context_oracle, so
  dark MUST read 0 on it: with that gate passed the e8 ledger says whether the
  late failure is SILENCE or a dark index, three-way and registered. G0 proves
  the per-eighth cells additive against a one-pass accumulation AND against the
  live cell_g/cell_n, which is what licenses re-deriving any window offline from
  the dumped matrix. G3 reproduces §58's four published phase windows to four
  decimals INCLUDING their SEs from an independently written scorer. No core
  change, no new genome field, no RNG draw. kRead: every branch prints
  Everything below is printed for debugging and is NOT a
  measurement; this run cannot pass whatever it reads.

  the question      §59a. NOT A TEST. §58 named a re-score on its expression
