  SIZING §59b, ON THE WINDOW FIXED IN THE PRE-REGISTRATION. The separation
  is A/E and the classifier refuses below 4.0, so this is the number that
  decides whether §59b exists. The SE falls as 1/sqrt(CREATURES) even though
  it barely falls with width -- that asymmetry is §58's power miss, so the
  required n is printed and not assumed.
